window.products.push({"id":238191,"name":"The Marriage Coin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41H76NJ+xYL._AC_.jpg","description":"His Hers - The Marriage Coin is a beautiful keepsake coin that reminds us that nothing can't be settled with the toss of a coin. His Hers - The Marriage Coin is the perfect gift for: Engagements, Bridal Showers, Weddings, Anniversaries, Vow Renewals, and more! The Legend of The Marriage Coin: Once upon a time, there stood a kingdom whose King and Queen were always happy. Their merriment made for a pleasant kingdom whose subjects were in turn equally content. The secret to the King and Queen's jubilance came from a gift they received from a loved one. The gift was an enchanted coin. When tossed, the coin would settle any instance of disagreement between them. One side of the coin read His, and the other, Hers. When His side landed face up, the King would use chivalry and valor in making his decision, as symbolized by the amour and swords that adorn the coin. Should Hers prevail, the Queen would practice caring and respect in carrying out her wishes, as promised by the crown and roses that decorate her side. This King and Queen's reign was of the happiest in history. A happiness attained simply by tossing... The Marriage Coin","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41H76NJ+xYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"His and hers","source_asin":"B0085NNECU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238191","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0085NNECU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0085NNECU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
