window.products.push({"id":238201,"name":"Brookstone Bed Fan with Wireless Remote","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UictpLcHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Operating your bed fan: After initial set up of your Bed Fan, use the Remote Control to adjust the airflow for maximum comfort. 1. Press the Power Button on the Remote to turn the Bed Fan on and off. The Power Button’s icon will illuminate for 5 seconds and then shut off. 2. The REMOTE CONTROL has a variable fan speed dial. You have an infinite number of adjustments you can make for your maximum comfort. Just turn the dial clockwise to increase the air-flow, and turn it counter-clockwise to decrease the airflow. We suggest you start off at a lower fan speed to get used to the feeling of the breeze blowing from the foot of the bed. 3. The LED Power Icon will illuminate for 5 seconds when the fan is on and when you adjust the speed of the fan. Altura ajustable Clarifica el grosor a ultra-thick colchones en una gran variedad de camas Wireless remote is backlit upon touch, has variable speed, and sits on the nightstand for easy-to-reach adjusting Circulates aire en las hojas para dispersar construido calor corporal y te mantiene cómodo durante toda la noche Great for couples with different temperature preferences, naturally warm-bodied people, and for alleviating night sweats More effective and efficient than traditional cooling methods, which only affect the air outside the sheets Adjustable height clears thick to ultra-thick mattresses on a variety of bed frames Más eficaz y eficiente que métodos tradicionales de refrigeración, que sólo afectan el aire fuera de las hojas Envía una brisa sobre el cuerpo en lugar de en toda la casa – apagar la corriente y ahorrar en los costes de refrigeración Sends a breeze over the body rather than the entire house–turn off the AC and save on cooling costs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UictpLcHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brookstone","source_asin":"B00L3EY29C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L3EY29C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L3EY29C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
