window.products.push({"id":238234,"name":"COLE & MASON Derwent Salt Grinder - Stainless Steel Mill Includes Gourmet Precision Mechanism and Premium Sea Salt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gWO0qIeDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your spices fresh and free from moisture with the Cole & Mason Derwent Salt Mill. This salt mill features an acrylic hourglass body with a stylish silver finish that will be visually stunning on your table or counter. With 3 grinding levels for sea, Himalayan and other salts, these adjustable spice grinders can produce fine powder, coarsely sliced spices or ground gourmet chunks. You can refill this grinder with your chosen salt through the easy-pull top cap. Use a coarse grind on salad tomatoes for extra texture or a fine grind for soups and sauces. Use this coarse salt grinder during and after cooking. This refillable salt mill and grinder will make a terrific wedding, holiday or house warming gift. Give the gift of flavor. Product Details: Care Instructions: Hand wash/do not submerge Warranty: Lifetime mechanism guarantee/2-year mill guarantee Color: Silver/Clear Materials: Stainless Steel/Acrylic Dimensions: 2.36\"\" x 2.36\"\" x 7.52\"\" Weight: 0.62 lb. Style, durability and dependability have been built into every Cole & Mason product since 1919. Using the best materials and mechanisms, our products have been praised by professional cooks and homemakers ever since. You can count on Cole & Mason to give your kitchen table salt and pepper grinder set a touch of class! Since the launch of our first mill, we have continued our expansion into a full range of seasoning products that include specialty mills, spice racks and oil and vinegar pourers. Our continued drive to deliver excellent design and performance has resulted in the award of CoolBrands status for 2015, an annual initiative to identify and pay tribute to the UK's coolest brands, voted for by the public. Allow our passion for great seasoning and a range of products crafted with care and quality to enhance your cooking experience, supporting you on a journey to release the flavor in your food.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gWO0qIeDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cole & Mason","source_asin":"B003OICYZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003OICYZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003OICYZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
