window.products.push({"id":238242,"name":"72 Pcs Butterfly Wall Decor Stickers, 3 Sizes 6 Styles Butterfly Decorations, 3D Butterfly Party Decorations/Birthday Decorations/Cake Decorations, La","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DNcjhYHML._SL1500_.jpg","description":"PACKAGE INCLUDES: 72 metallic butterfly decors in 6 styles. Each style has 3 sizes in 12cm (4.72) of large, 10cm (3.93”) of medium and 8cm (3.15”) of small, and every size with 4 pieces. The package also contains 72 pieces of removable double-sided adhesive and extra 72 enhanced glue dots for better paste even in rough condition. EXQUISITE 3D METALLIC CUTOUT: All the butterfly decors are in delicate, intricate carvings of metallic paper and bright color to create an amazing illusion on the wall, not just a simple silhouettes of butterfly but also has detailed hollow out of complex patterns. The wings can be folded to achieve 3D effect and vivid molding, the wings flap gently especially when there is a breeze. STRONG STICKINESS & REMOVABLE: Beside the ordinary 72 double sided adhesive in the package, there are also extra 72 stronger glue dots additionally for rough surfaces, making sure you can paste it anywhere you want. They all very easy and quick to stick on the clean, smooth surface and remove without paint chipping or damaging walls, no sticky residue left behind, no peeling of wall paint. GOOD DECORATIONS FOR ANYWHERE: This pop, cute decors have wide applications like embellishing above crib besides name plaque and birth stats sign in nursery or adding a little whimsy on empty walls, party balloon garland, graduation cap, hallway and porch, mirror, cake, gift box, artistic photographing, or ornamenting office. Quite visually interesting and economical for such a large area. PERFECT GADGETS FOR ANY OCCASIONS: Use this set to bring an elegant visually interesting hit for your event especially on the party, baby and bridal shower, Halloween, theme party, wedding, birthday, anniversary and holiday. Also perfect for rental living and panel walls decorating. Cute added touch to your home and economical for such a large area.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DNcjhYHML._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NETANY","source_asin":"B09Z6H1HTS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238242","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z6H1HTS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z6H1HTS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
