window.products.push({"id":238301,"name":"Hafmall Insulated Lunch Bag for Women/Men, 12L (18 Cans) Leakproof Lunch Box for Adults, Womens Lunch Bag for Work, Reusable Lunch Cooler Tote Bag wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81swmKwLpaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY LUNCH BAG: This is a durable and easy to clean lunch bag with a high-quality water-resistant Oxford fabric exterior, and premium PEVA with 6mm thickened PE foam interior to keep food cool/warm for 6-8 hours. WIDE OPENING LARGE CAPACITY LUNCH BAG: This is a standard rectangular lunch box bag, the size is 10.24\"x7.87\"x9.44\", which can hold 18 Cans (1can=330ml). The main compartment with double zip design that wraps around three sides of the bag and extends to the back, so it is easy to flip the top open and access the contents, which will help you pack and access food and drinks easily. SPACIOUS LUNCH BAG WITH MULTI-POCKETS: This is a multi-purpose lunch bag, it has a big main compartment and other 5 compartments/pockets for your napkins, water bottles, utensils, etc, including 1 front large zippered pocket, 2 elastic side pockets (one of them is the wipe pocket), 1 back small zippered pocket, 1 top mesh compartment. The multi-pocket large capacity design makes it perfect for work, beach, picnics, etc. LEAKPROOF LUNCH BAG: The PEVA lining of lunch bag features seamless heat press technology, so in daily use, you do not have to worry about the leakage of soup or beverages, and you can even directly put ice inside to chill drinks or food. MULTIPLE CARRYING OPTIONS: This is a portable lunch tote bag, it has sturdy handles with Velcro and a removable and adjustable shoulder strap, you can carry it as the way you like. Hafmall offers a variety of colors for adult choice, such as black, green, pink and so on, with simple and modern design style, very suitable for women/men for work.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81swmKwLpaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hafmall","source_asin":"B0C16SFKK7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238301","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C16SFKK7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C16SFKK7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
