window.products.push({"id":238345,"name":"Portable Travel Clothes Steamer Iron, Hanging/Flat Handheld Garment Steamer and Steam Iron with 2 Brushes, Handy Clothes Steamer, Temperature Control,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611IQNHRVEL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"PACKAGE INCLUDED 1x Steamer Iron with Safety stand 1x Linen brush, Bristle brush 1x Measuring cup 1x User manual FEATURE Fast heat up in the 20s, 800W strong power 3 type of ironing surfaces 3 temperature modes control 2 in 1 vertically steaming and horizontal ironing clothes. SPECIFICATION Wattage: 800W Voltage: 110V, 50HZ Unite weight: 1.21lb Length of cord: 5.1 ft Water tank capacity: 100ml(80ml Suggestion) Steam Duration: 15 minutes Preheat time: 20 seconds Please use a transformer that can convert the voltage to 110V when using this steamer abroad. QA How to use it? 1.  Turn to \"OFF\" knob 2.pour into water(Place horizontally. Don’t shake) 3.Turn to \"MAX\" knob 4. Wait the light went from bright to dark, select the appropriate temperature 5. Press the steam button to use 6. After cooling, Pour out the water, power on for 1-2 minutes till the water inside evaporates. Do I need to cover cloth on the clothes when I use them? If it's flat with a ceramic base plate, make sure you put a piece of cloth on it and don't touch it directly because the temperature is too high. If there is still water in the sink after use, must it be discarded? Yes. When not in use, the water must be drained and then energized to dry the water inside the machine. NOTE - Don't add water over the Max water line. - It is a normal phenomenon that there are beads of water on the water tank. The steamer passes 100% water injection test before leaving the factory. - Make sure you turn off the power in case of leaking water when you add some water into the tank. - Don't press the release button in case of leaking water when the LED indicator is red.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611IQNHRVEL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dream-C","source_asin":"B081SJ4TYP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081SJ4TYP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081SJ4TYP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
