window.products.push({"id":238427,"name":"French Butter Crock, LOVECASA Ceramic Butter Dish with Lid for Countertop, Farmhouse Butter Keeper Container with Water Line, Perfect for West or East","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51guduqLk-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SPREADABLE AND FRESH BUTTER】: Who doesn’t love soft butter? Compared with traditional butter dishes. LOVECASA butter crock keeps the butter fresh and soft without having to the refrigerator. Cold water creates an airtight seal that preserves the freshness of the butter at room temperature, no more cold and hard butter 【EASY TO USE】: Make sure the butter crock is clean and dry before using. Firstly, pack softened butter into the bottom of the crock. Secondly, pour cold water into the base of the crock to the water line and add a little salt or vinegar to the water is helpful to keep it fresh, while it doesn't affect the taste of the butter either. Finally, please refresh your water every 2-3 days to lock in freshness 【SAFE & DURABLE CERAMIC】: This butter container is made of durable professional-grade porcelain, which is fired at 2000 degrees to create a smooth, scratch-resistant surface. Premium LEAD-FREE ceramic, chip-resistant, and more sturdy than stoneware. It is easy to clean by hand and available for dishwasher 【UPGRADED LARGE CAPACITY】: LOVECASA butter keeper compared with other butter keepers in the marketplace, with large capacity which is wide and deep enough to fit a wide range of shaped sticks of butter, it can hold 1 and 1/2 sticks butter and suitable for most families 【MATCH YOUR KITCHEN PERFECTLY】: The design of LOVECASA butter keeper is so simple and modern, which is a practical and excellent addition to the kitchen. For Thanksgiving, Christmas, Easter, or any festival, it will be a good choice as a gift","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51guduqLk-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOVECASA","source_asin":"B0B2RNNCB5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238427","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2RNNCB5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2RNNCB5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":238428,"name":"King Size Zippered Mattress Protector - Waterproof Mattress Cover - Hypoallergenic Dust Allergy Proof Bed Encasement - Deep Pocket Cotton Terry Top","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814SjSyH4bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fits 12\" to 16\" Thick King Mattress SIX SIDED ZIPPERED ENCASEMENT - Completely encases your mattress on all sides. Our premium zippered encasements are equipped with a Velcro zipper seal to ensure that nothing gets in! Say good-bye to troublesome pets that can ruin your mattress and bring discomfort to your life. Take precaution and sleep worry-free knowing that your mattress is shielded and protected. Be smart and protect your investment with a quality mattress encasement! WATERPROOF - Whether you have pets or kids, accidents and spills can happen. This 100% waterproof mattress protector blocks liquids and moisture from getting in and keeps your mattress dry and protected! ALLERGY RELIEF - Do you suffer from allergies? Sleeping on an unprotected mattress can expose you to allergens and dust making it difficult to breathe and sleep. Seal out dust, pet hair and allergens for good! Hypoallergenic construction shields you from irritating allergens and an impenetrable cover helps you breathe easy. SOFT & NOISELESS - Soft Cotton Terry surface is completely noiseless, you will not hear crinkles under your sheets. Breathable fabric keeps liquids, contaminants and allergens out without compromising comfort. EASY TO INSTALL - Our mattress covers have a full zipper that completely wraps all the way around three sides of the mattress. No more struggling squeezing your mattress into difficult encasements, simply place your mattress in the sealed end and zip all the way around it for a perfect fit. DURABLE & LONG-LASTING - This six-sided zippered encasement fully encases your mattress on all sides and made to fit a King size mattress. Machine washable for easy cleaning and lasting use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814SjSyH4bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Four Seasons Essentials","source_asin":"B08G8T9SPT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238428","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G8T9SPT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G8T9SPT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
