window.products.push({"id":238489,"name":"Insulated Rolltop Lunch Bag For Women, Men, Adults And Teens,Lunch Box With Adjustable Shoulder Strap,Multi-Pocket Lunch Bags For Work, Office, Picnic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ubhv4vh8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1. Large capacity and versatile : Measuring 8.67\" x 6.5\" x 13\" (L x W x H), this insulated lunch bag can hold up to 12 330ml cans of soda.ENOCOPY's lunch box bag embodies the adventurous mood of every outing, versatile and suitable for any outdoor activity. Whether you're attending a live event, going to an amusement park, taking a class at school, hiking or even working, we've got your back. 2. Ultimate Performance and Durability: Superior and ultimate performance comes from our temperature-controlled design. Our roll-up top with three layers of insulation is perfectly sealed against hot and cold air, keeping your food fresh for hours. Combined with high quality nylon fabric, the exterior of this lunch bag can withstand any humid environment and is easy to wipe clean. 3. Easy to carry: This collapsible compact lunch bag can be squeezed and inserted into your backpack or carry-on bag. The powerful lunch box comes with a removable, adjustable shoulder strap designed to free up your hands and make you unstoppable. 4.Functional yet eye-catching - a back pocket compartment is available for organizing small things like napkins, forks, wallet or cards. In a world of ever-changing style, we’ve got the solution: one bag, many designs. Mix up your look with one of our many interchangeable colors or patterns designed by community artists we love, there’s always a color available to match your vibe. These are perfect lunch bags for men women, teen girls and adults. 5.Safety: No BPA or other toxic substances, instead we use only food-grade materials in all our products. By creating double stitching and reinforcing materials on the lunch bag, the reinforced lining and carry handle strap will make your bag durable, sturdy, and provide years of lasting value.Our lunch bag follow a strict set of specifications and quality standards, however, if a problem develops, we will provide you with the best solution!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ubhv4vh8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ENOCOPY","source_asin":"B09PNLYNFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238489","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PNLYNFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PNLYNFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
