window.products.push({"id":238514,"name":"SUPJOYES 5 Pairs Fiberglass Chopsticks, Multicolor Reusable Chop Sticks Japanese Style, Non-Slip Chopsticks Gift Set Dishwasher Safe, 9 1/2 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QK90HDAML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[UNIQUE DESIGN] The chopsticks are carved with beautiful Japanese cherry blossom pattern, which comes with 5 different delightful colors. Assemble with other cutlery and tableware, this colorful flatware will adds cheerful atmosphere to your dining table. It’s easy to distinguish with multicolor design, one person may has one color chopsticks. The length of chopsticks is about 9.5 inches. [REUSABLE MATERIAL] SUPJOYES reusable fiberglass chopsticks are constructed by BPA-Free, Non-Toxic material. No coating, no lacquered and odorless. More sterile than wood chop sticks for food, without the metallic taste of metal chopsticks. High-quality fiberglass material is not easy to bend and deform, rust resistant and non-corrosive. So these chopsticks look like new after years of service. [DISHWASHER SAFE] Our reusable chopsticks are easy to clean and 100% dishwasher safe. You can convenient hand-wash up them quickly in the sink, or pop them into the dishwasher without trouble, they don't warp or melt. Please put chopsticks in utensil holder when using dishwasher, to avoid the risk of falling in through the slits of the dishwasher. [NON SLIP DESIGN] The un-cylindrical body prevents the chopsticks from rolling through fingertips, making it easier to pick up noodles, ramen, sushi, salad, spaghetti and etc. The non slip tip has frosted texture, effectively prevent food from falling off between your chopsticks. The appropriate weight and length make these reusable chopsticks feels great in hand. [IDEAL GIFT CHOICE] It’s the perfect fancy chopsticks gift set to family and friends with exquisite gift-ready packaging. Fine craftsmanship with attractive design make our chopsticks so distinctive. Great gift choice for Christmas, Birthday, Housewarming and Anniversaries. A must-have dining kit, kitchen utensil set for fans of Japanese, Chinese, Korean, Thai and other Asian dishes with SUPJOYES chopsticks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QK90HDAML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPJOYES","source_asin":"B0B49RM7KW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B49RM7KW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B49RM7KW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":238515,"name":"Walker Edison Saxon Mid-Century Modern 2-Door Corner Accent Cabinet, 30 Inch, Dark Walnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":172.14,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415NrCWuSRL._AC_.jpg","description":"Accentuate the alcoves of your space when you angle this contemporary accent cabinet in just the right spot. Those empty niches of your living room, entryway, or den will soon showcase your novels, décor, and miscellaneous treasures in corner-situated charm. A single adjustable shelf is the perfect hideaway for clutter you’d like to conceal, like board games or spare linens. With a cord management port and included wall anchor hardware, this trendy console can quickly transform into a multifunctional media hub. Whether you’re looking for a piece to spruce up blank spaces or a simple style upgrade, this cabinet is in your corner.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415NrCWuSRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Walker Edison","source_asin":"B09W3DCWPV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238515","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W3DCWPV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W3DCWPV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":238516,"name":"OrlovNY Swarovski Crystals Faberge Egg: Lily of The Valley Faberge Style Egg Box Jewelry Box Limited Edition Collectible Faberge Reproduction","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IYoAAp0HL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Lily of the Valley egg was made by Faberge in 1898 for Emperor Nicholas II, who gave it as an Easter present to his wife, Empress Alexandra. An elegant souvenir for true fans of beautiful things, this collectible egg is rendered in the style of Carl Faberge, the famous jeweler of the Russian Imperial Court. The box features decorative Swarovski crystals and an enamel finish. Faberge never made duplicates, so each egg is a one of a kind, unique masterpiece. This Lily of the Valley box is an iconic symbol of modern style. It makes a great gift on its own, or you can place a surprise gift inside it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IYoAAp0HL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OrlovNY","source_asin":"B077YSGB62","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077YSGB62","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077YSGB62","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
