window.products.push({"id":238641,"name":"Asvert Mini Butter Melting Pot, Butter Coffee Milk Warmer with Spout 18/10 Tri-Ply Stainless Steel (450ml)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jtUFoaUGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Nice pan. It’s sturdy and well constructed. This little stainless steel, Induction-compatible pot is extremely well made, and heavy-duty. Totally unexpected quality for sure! Dual-lipped edge, The spouts work really well, and it’s great that there’s one on each side, so it doesn’t matter whether you’re pouring with your left or right hand. The handle is very securely riveted to the pan and long enough to avoid heating excessively while using. Another space-saving feature with this is the hole in the handle, allowing me to hang it on the wall. Inside markings for 150 ML and 300 ML. They are indelible markings on the inside of the pan for precise liquid measurement. The bottom is perfectly flat and relatively broad, and the tri-ply makes it heavy enough to sit evenly on the heavy grates of the gas range, without tipping, even though it’s a very small pan. The tri-ply aluminum encapsulated base is also made to assure quick uniform heating over the entire bottom. This is a perfect little pan for making small batches of sauces: making teriyaki sauce, melting butter or cheese, heating milk for coffee, as well as heating sake in Japanese pouring bottles. Another surprising feature I found is that I had no issues with food sticking to the bottom. The pan cleans very easily and if any stains or marks are left after using, they can be removed quickly in a number of ways using vinegar, barkeepers friend, lemon juice, or other methods. Exceptional design, function, and performance. A clear winner without heavy branding. FIve Stars and a very honest and hearty recommendation if you are looking for a very small pan like this!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jtUFoaUGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Asvert","source_asin":"B07X353PRV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238641","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X353PRV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X353PRV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
