window.products.push({"id":238700,"name":"Saffron Fabs 100% Soft Cotton, 2 Piece Set, 34x21 and 36x24 Inch, Reversible,Color Multi Blue, GSF 220, Pattern Woven Stripes Bath Rug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1aVqBPGsWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorate your Home/Bathroom with this Saffron Fabs Woven Stripe Cotton Bath Rug. This rug features a Two Tone Reversible Pattern that adds a casual, relaxed feel to your bathroom. This rug is made of 100% Soft Cotton to provide higher water absorbance, perfect for bathrooms as these soaks water quickly. Thick pile texture enhances its softness. This rug is available in many colors such as Beige, Blue, Grey, Green, Ivory, Orange, Yellow and White. This rug comes in 4 sizes (21-inch x 17-inch, 34-inch x 21-inch, 36-inch x 24 inch, 50-inch x 30-inch) to fit in any available space. These rugs are dyed with colors using sustainable AZO free dyes. Saffron Fabs bath rugs can be used as area rug in Kitchen, Bedroom, Hotels, and SPA etc. These rugs are machine washable, cold separately; gentle cycle. Do not pull long yarn ends; trim with scissors. Please do not select thick (heavier GSF) rugs if door opens on top of rug as it may cause issues opening the door. Most cotton rugs are handmade in different lots, therefore there might be some variance in color/ size/ design. Also, rugs are folded after manufacturing to put on cartons for shipping, and many times crease/fold line are very visible, which will settle after some period of usage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1aVqBPGsWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saffron Fabs","source_asin":"B014HNWKPI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238700","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014HNWKPI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014HNWKPI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":238701,"name":"Neck Fan 2021 New Personal Portable Wearable Air Conditioner Lazy Bladeless Leafless Hands Free Hanging Neck Band Fans 9000mAh Usb Rechargable Cooling","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-MSkuyjvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2021 New Wearable Cooling Device】The newest designed JOLUME portable neck fan in 2021, with 48 wind outlets and 60pcs twin-turbine leafless hanging neck fan,multiplied wind power and can quickly feel cool in 3s.No traditional blades,Don't worry about your hair getting involved in the Fan,you can shape your hairstyle at will,More secure,More beautiful.Bladeless neck fan can be used safely for children women men and the elderly. 【Hands Free Neck Fan &Personal Fan】The JOLUME portable hanging neck fan is as light and portable as a headset and is hung around the neck.The special handheld design allows you to lazy neck fan and enjoy the neck cooler while doing what you want to do. fan that goes around your neck for traveling in hot weather,which saves you from the embarrassment of dripping sweat in public places. 【Low Noise Design & Comfortable】The JOLUME wearable air conditioner’s motor has been modified so that will produce lower noise during operation. Made of Eco-friendly ABS and silicone.Makes neck cooling device softer and more durable and quieter. 【USB Rechargeable & 3 Speed Wind】JOLUME neck fans portable USB rechargeable, convenient to charge via computer, cell phone charger, power bank,laptops etc.Built-in 9600mAh battery provide 9 to 18 working hours duration (depend on different speeds).Personal cooling device 3 wind speeds can be adjusted at will to meet any needs of you. 【Wide Range of uses】JOLUME personal neck fans are easy to carry and easy to store, and truly hanging neck fan. Indoor activities are great outdoors! It is an item which works in every scene such as summer festival,outdoor,BBQ,sports watching,walking,climbing,excursion,festival,commuting,and school.Summer can be used as personal neck fan.You can enjoy clean and comfortable air.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-MSkuyjvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOLUME","source_asin":"B091C7YCC1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238701","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091C7YCC1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091C7YCC1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
