window.products.push({"id":238752,"name":"TopHat Leather Wedding Guest Book Set with Professional Picture Frame, Guest Cards, and Blank Pages for Polaroid Photos (96 Pages)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616QeKshFdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This timeless wedding guest book set is designed to be the perfect keepsake with plenty of space for hundreds of guests to share loving notes and memories with the happy couple on their wedding day. This guest book prominently features a 5\"\" x 7\"\" commemorative picture frame for a professional photograph to honor and celebrate the newly wed couple. Our book set includes dozens of thoughtful pages such as biographical information, ceremonial details, and family information that you won't find in other books. The book accommodates over 185 guests names, addresses, emails, and messages. It features unique pages for specific details regarding the courtship, wedding preparations, showers, rehearsal dinner, wedding party and wedding reception. There are open spaces for wedding invitation, and wedding program. The blank pages at the end of the book are perfect for scrapbooking, polaroid pictures, additional photos, and keepsakes. Wedding guest book with 96 pages is 9.25 inches x 9.25 inches; includes 200 guest cards 3.5 inches x 5 inches, commemorative picture frame 5 inches x 7 inches, black and gold metal pen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616QeKshFdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TopHat","source_asin":"B07XBV3H5M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238752","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XBV3H5M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XBV3H5M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
