window.products.push({"id":238803,"name":"Decorative Wood Grain Wallpaper Self Adhesive Shelf Liner Peel and Stick Wallpaper for Kitchen Cabinet Drawer Countertop Door Shelves 17.7 Inch by 78 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F9AxGTCUL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Redecorating your cabinet, countertop, furniture table etc Just need purchase one roll contact paper, then stick the contact paper to flat place you want, it can make them looks like new one. Instruction for Use: 1. It can be placed on any smooth clean and dry surface like shelf, board, wood cabinet, drawer, walls, window, glass and so on. It is best applied at room temperature. 2. Sand down rough surfaces prior to sticking. Clean large surfaces with mild soap and water. 3. Measure the surface to cover. Cut the film into right size, leaving about 5cm extra overlap on all edges is better. 4. Peel off the backing paper evenly with one hand whilst smoothing the film to the surface. With your other hand, from the center to edges. For this it's better to use a soft cloth.5. Creases and air bubbles can be removed by applying light pressure from the center to the edges. Pierce stubborn bubbles with a needle and squeeze the air out. Note: Please buy enough roll paper one time to avoid the effect of batch color difference.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F9AxGTCUL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Walldecor1","source_asin":"B07HDZVX2Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HDZVX2Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HDZVX2Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":238804,"name":"Neecan Herringbone Striped Black and White Fabric Shower Curtain, Modern Home Bathroom Decorations for Shower Stalls and Tubs, with Hooks. 71inch x 71","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xU07+8jFS._AC_SL1026_.jpg","description":"Quality Guarantee:3D printed fabric shower curtain with black and white stripe pattern,long-lasting effects. Waterproof Material:The fabric shower curtain is using water resistant breathable coating material that is dries quickly for maximum comfort. Better Vertical Sense:The plumb is at the bottom for better fixation and hang down feeling,you don't need to worry it will sway or stick to the body. Giving Hooks:There are 12 reinforced antirust holes on the top,comes with 12 C shaped shower curtain rings that is easy to installed without taking the rod down. Machine Washable:The bathroom curtain can be washed by washing machine,easy operation and convenience cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xU07+8jFS._AC_SL1026_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Neecan","source_asin":"B08CTXL9CD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238804","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CTXL9CD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CTXL9CD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":238805,"name":"Non Slip Shower Mat Square, 24x24 Inch Square Bath Mat, Loofah Shower Mats Non Slip, Square Shower Tray Mat, Soft Textured Bath Mat for Tub, Bathroom ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WGkjR7AML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🦶【Comfortable Shower Mats】: Soft loofah-like textured surface of ideal thickness makes this get naked shower mat comfortable for your shower in bare feet. Besides cutting the cold hard floor off from your body and providing a warm support, it also gently massages your skin while providing a cushioned and comfortable support when you are in the shower, away from the hard and cold ordinary bathroom mat. 🛁【Shower Mat Non Slip & Durable】: The loofah shower mat made of durable, Phthalate-free, PVC plastic. No suction cups. It uses an anti-slip layer that stays firm while being gentle on bathroom textured surfaces. Instead of traditional bath mats with difficult cleaning suction cups, our bath tub mat have more practical and durable plaid backings. The lattice patterns on its bottom can ensure the safety of your family by holding the loofah bath mat steadily in place. 💧【Outstanding Draining】: Our anti slip shower mat with natural drain holes, loop surface and lattice bottom can work together to encourage water to flow past the get naked bath mat without getting caught. No need to worry about blocking water. The hollow surface of the loofah shower mat allows water to leak easily, and the bottom can be firmly fixed on the surface of the bathtub without worrying about slipping, while keeping it soft and not damaging the surface of the bathtub. 💖【Easy to Clean & Quickly Dry】: You can simply use a shower head to rinse out the foam on the anti slip bath shower mat top, and just leave the mat with lattice bottom up on your bathroom floor, or hang over your bathtub and air dry. Our bath mats for bathroom are washable in warm water. Loofah surface dry quickly and allows water to flow through it and drain out, will not create any smell and marks on your floor. [NOTE] It is strongly recommended that you clean the bath mat before first use. 🏊【Multi-scene Application】: The non slip tub mat with additional non-skid performance, it grips the floor to stay in place and enhance safety. This loofah non slip shower mat can be perfectly applied whether it is inside or outside your bathtub, shower tray, bathroom, and washbasin. The fashionable design brings a warm and comfortable feeling to your room. Safe and ideal for use in your private home and public places, like restaurants, schools, dorm, gym, spa, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WGkjR7AML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MARIBUR","source_asin":"B0BJTLQHGZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJTLQHGZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJTLQHGZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
