window.products.push({"id":238974,"name":"3-Piece Airlock with #6 Stopper and Grommet 4 Pack, Fermentation Airlock Beer Wine Kombucha Brewing Kit,Carboy Airlock FDA Transparency Upgraded","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716TJgKMWCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Should You Use an Airlock When Fermenting? There are many techniques for fermenting, but none are as effective as when you ferment with an airlock.  Whether you are a beginner wondering “how do I ferment?” or someone who takes their fermenting very seriously, utilizing an airlock is not something that should be overlooked. They simply help to prevent many of the problems that can occur during the fermentation process.  If you don’t have one,click into your cart now to get some ,making your fermenting even more simple and dependable. Features: ▶Includes body, piston, and vented cap.  ▶This airlock is easy to disassemble and clean out in the event of a blow-off. ▶It has been very rare to have something go bad during the fermentation process. ▶Airlocks create a true anaerobic environment which is required for healthy ferments.  ▶Fill with 1/2 water& insert in drilled stopper or bung to vent gases during fermentation.  ▶These 3 - piece airlocks are easy to use and allow you to make smaller batches when desired. Package Includes: 4 x Airlock Grommet 4 x Silicone Stopper #6 4 x Airlock 3 Piece Type Warm Tips: 1.Only fill your airlocks with clean water. 2.Clean and sanitize the airlock and plug before each use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716TJgKMWCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Molovee","source_asin":"B08ML8G5D2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238974","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ML8G5D2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ML8G5D2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
