window.products.push({"id":238988,"name":"Insulated Water Bottle With 2 Lids By Cruet- Stainless Steel Double-Walled Leakproof Thermos With Straw Lid For Cold Drinks, Flip Lid For Hot Beverage","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512d5Vex0hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INSULATED, STAINLESS STEEL WATER BOTTLE FOR THE PERFECT TEMPERATURE: The Cruet insulated sports water bottle is made of premium, BPA-free and food-safe, rust-resistant stainless steel materials that can help retain your drink’s desired temperature for hours. For cold drinks that remain cold for up to 24 hours, and hot drinks that are still warm even after 12 hours, Cruet is the way to go 100% LEAKPROOF, VACUUM-INSULATED, DOUBLE WALLED FLASK: Well-made, with a double-walled, vacuum insulated design, you may rest-assured that your water will stay cold and refreshing even during the hottest summer days. It’s also completely leakproof so you can take it with you at all times, without worrying about messy leaks. Oh, and no more metal taste or other annoyances! GREAT VALUE - 2 LIDS INCLUDED FOR HOT & COLD DRINKS: Our wide-mouth insulated water bottles come with 2 super-practical lids to offer a comfortable drinking experience with any type of drink. The straw lid is great for water, coffee, ice-tea, smoothies, protein-shakes, homemade juices or any other cold drink. You will also receive a flip lid for your favorite hot beverages including coffee and tea. POWDER-COATED BOTTLES FOR COMFORTABLE GRIP ON THE GO: Thanks to their powder-coated finish that ensures a non-slip, comfortable grip with hot and cold drinks, these thermos water bottles are just what you need to enjoy any drink on the go. What’s more, they are compatible with most standard-sized cup holders and they make a safe, environmentally conscious choice that reduces the use of damaging plastic bottles MODERN INSULATED WATER BOTTLE IN SIZES & COLORS: The Cruet portable and reusable water bottles come in different sizes to find the one that best matches your needs. Available in two beautiful, eye-catching and modern colors, they are perfect for any man, woman, teen or kid. Plus, they make an out-of-the-box gift idea any lucky recipient is sure to love!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512d5Vex0hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cruet","source_asin":"B0BQX3C2GR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-238988","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQX3C2GR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQX3C2GR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
